WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
video file and english subs: Safex

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:08.297
Scattering flower petals of springtime

00:00:11.375 --> 00:00:15.381
Mr. McGregor is very sick.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:20.272
He is painfully calling the name ''Mina''.

00:00:25.101 --> 00:00:29.777
However, Mina is not a person's name.

00:00:29.927 --> 00:00:33.301
It's a St. Bernard dog.

00:00:33.839 --> 00:00:35.573
You are Mina?

00:00:39.196 --> 00:00:41.730
I really am a dim-wit!

00:00:43.415 --> 00:00:47.356
It's not the time to play.
Your master is dying.

00:00:49.039 --> 00:00:51.378
Do you understand what I mean?

00:00:51.717 --> 00:00:53.451
Come on. Follow me.

00:00:56.339 --> 00:00:57.768
This dog is coming with you?

00:00:58.618 --> 00:01:01.259
Please... Mr. McGregor wants to see it.

00:01:03.302 --> 00:01:07.848
He wants to see a dog before he dies?
What a strange old man.

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:10.598
Mr. McGregor is not going to die.

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:14.004
Mina, get on.

00:01:20.008 --> 00:01:22.177
Please, help me!

00:01:22.485 --> 00:01:25.019
I hate dogs.

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:27.294
Especially their smell.

00:01:29.482 --> 00:01:34.333
Mina, good dog.
I am taking you to see your master.

00:01:36.411 --> 00:01:39.648
I am taking you to see Mr. McGregor.

00:01:39.798 --> 00:01:41.562
McGregor.

00:01:42.169 --> 00:01:43.835
Come, Mina.

00:01:44.713 --> 00:01:46.780
Good kid, come on.

00:01:48.966 --> 00:01:51.804
Forget it!
It's not listening to you.

00:01:54.424 --> 00:01:56.059
I have an idea!

00:01:56.768 --> 00:01:59.633
What? I am busy.

00:01:59.783 --> 00:02:03.809
Mr. McGregor's belongings.
Do we have any here?

00:02:04.009 --> 00:02:05.827
The master's....

00:02:05.977 --> 00:02:07.433
Suits or shirts.

00:02:07.583 --> 00:02:12.591
Don't be kidding.
I am not the master's wife.

00:02:12.769 --> 00:02:16.879
You know how Mr. McGregor is like.

00:02:17.992 --> 00:02:20.259
I am going to let Mina smell his things.

00:02:20.409 --> 00:02:22.572
I refuse.

00:02:37.108 --> 00:02:38.945
A fishing tackle?

00:02:39.251 --> 00:02:40.781
Aunt!

00:02:41.427 --> 00:02:43.591
Why are you still here?

00:02:43.741 --> 00:02:46.545
Is this Mr. McGregor's fishing tackle?

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:48.915
That's the master's favorite....

00:02:49.065 --> 00:02:52.873
- I'll bring it back.
- Wait! That's....

00:02:54.518 --> 00:02:56.652
Come on, get on!

00:02:57.363 --> 00:03:00.102
Mina, your master is waiting for you.

00:03:00.644 --> 00:03:04.013
Follow me, Mina, Come on!

00:03:04.862 --> 00:03:06.302
Come on, get on!

00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:11.951
That's right. Good kid.

00:03:13.801 --> 00:03:15.173
Good. Get on.

00:03:18.086 --> 00:03:19.821
Good. Mina.

00:03:21.903 --> 00:03:23.877
Where are you going? Mina!

00:03:25.585 --> 00:03:27.182
Wait!

00:03:35.262 --> 00:03:36.703
Mina!

00:03:39.112 --> 00:03:40.708
Mina!

00:03:40.858 --> 00:03:43.055
Where did you go?

00:03:46.002 --> 00:03:48.945
Mina.

00:03:52.469 --> 00:03:54.532
Mina.

00:03:54.682 --> 00:03:57.783
I don't have time
to play games with you.

00:03:58.597 --> 00:04:00.095
Where are you going?

00:04:01.307 --> 00:04:04.012
Where are you taking me to?

00:04:16.006 --> 00:04:18.908
What a beautiful place!

00:04:31.774 --> 00:04:36.023
I see.
You want to take me fishing?

00:04:38.536 --> 00:04:43.820
I get it! Mr. McGregor must
often bring you here fishing.

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:25.533
A huge fish!

00:05:30.864 --> 00:05:34.338
Look, Mina! A huge fish!

00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:38.157
We are so lucky!

00:05:42.482 --> 00:05:47.462
I can imagine Mr. McGregor going fishing.

00:05:48.408 --> 00:05:49.902
But, Mina.

00:05:50.052 --> 00:05:52.618
Your master's life is in danger.

00:05:53.731 --> 00:05:56.370
He wants to see you.

00:05:57.913 --> 00:06:01.692
Come on,
let's get on the carriage together.

00:06:17.002 --> 00:06:19.731
Candy!

00:06:21.017 --> 00:06:22.813
I have been looking for you.

00:06:22.963 --> 00:06:24.484
I am sorry.

00:06:24.634 --> 00:06:28.438
It's time to go back to the hospital.
The headmistress is very wordy.

00:06:28.588 --> 00:06:29.640
No problem now.

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:31.281
Mina....

00:06:32.833 --> 00:06:36.167
Why isn't Mina getting on?

00:06:36.317 --> 00:06:39.186
Forget about that dog.

00:06:39.336 --> 00:06:42.172
No, I'll walk back with her.

00:06:43.345 --> 00:06:48.156
What? It will be dark
when you get to the hospital.

00:06:48.306 --> 00:06:51.207
Maybe it will be faster this way.

00:06:52.752 --> 00:06:54.850
Whatever.

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:58.030
But, the carriage will not go with you.

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:00.877
It's ok.
You go back first.

00:07:01.027 --> 00:07:05.062
Don't tell the headmistress
that Mina is a dog.

00:07:11.996 --> 00:07:14.173
Mina, come out.

00:07:16.088 --> 00:07:17.559
Let's go.

00:07:21.678 --> 00:07:24.120
- That dim-wit!
- Sorry.

00:07:24.725 --> 00:07:28.297
She insists to find Miss Mina.

00:07:28.447 --> 00:07:30.982
Did you see Mina?

00:07:31.822 --> 00:07:33.552
Well....

00:07:33.702 --> 00:07:35.298
Headmistress!

00:07:37.648 --> 00:07:41.192
Hurry! Mr. McGregor...

00:07:51.744 --> 00:07:54.416
He is unconscious.

00:07:54.755 --> 00:07:57.129
He can only make it
till tomorrow morning.

00:07:59.676 --> 00:08:01.582
Headmistress...

00:08:01.785 --> 00:08:05.220
Still haven't found Mina?

00:08:05.370 --> 00:08:08.782
The patient's sheet slipped.

00:08:10.624 --> 00:08:14.431
Nurses must hang on to the end.

00:08:14.581 --> 00:08:16.242
Remember that.

00:08:16.985 --> 00:08:18.352
Yes, I understand.

00:08:21.337 --> 00:08:23.271
Mina.

00:08:23.882 --> 00:08:25.486
Mina.

00:08:26.863 --> 00:08:28.897
Mina.

00:08:52.238 --> 00:08:56.587
This wouldn't happen
if we would have taken the carriage.

00:09:00.342 --> 00:09:02.205
He is coming back.

00:09:04.993 --> 00:09:09.008
You think
this carriage is coming back for you?

00:09:11.691 --> 00:09:14.902
That's alright.
I won't force you to take the ride.

00:09:18.788 --> 00:09:20.390
Mina!

00:09:30.073 --> 00:09:31.974
What happened?

00:09:33.752 --> 00:09:36.194
- Mr. McGregor's dog?
- No! Mina!

00:09:40.215 --> 00:09:43.023
She got on herself?

00:09:43.294 --> 00:09:45.229
Oh well....

00:09:45.439 --> 00:09:48.749
You are going back to Mr. McGregor's?

00:09:49.085 --> 00:09:50.245
You know him?

00:09:50.395 --> 00:09:54.306
Not very well. It's always like this
when taking my ride.

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:57.476
Get off.
This is for people.

00:09:57.626 --> 00:09:59.151
Get off.

00:09:59.431 --> 00:10:03.910
She hates the carriages.
Why did she get on itself?

00:10:04.118 --> 00:10:08.325
Mr. McGregor took this carriage
when he went to the hospital.

00:10:08.475 --> 00:10:12.779
You will see Mr. McGregor
if you take this carriage.

00:10:12.929 --> 00:10:16.872
I try to avoid
getting close to Mr. McGregor's house.

00:10:18.211 --> 00:10:19.843
Get off!

00:10:21.428 --> 00:10:24.669
Could you take us to the hospital?

00:10:26.683 --> 00:10:30.156
I am a practice nurse
at Joseph Hospital.

00:10:30.566 --> 00:10:32.803
Mr. McGregor wants to see her.

00:10:33.009 --> 00:10:35.411
Is Mr. McGregor serious?

00:10:35.561 --> 00:10:36.714
Yes.

00:10:36.864 --> 00:10:40.970
I will take her to the hospital
for neighbor's sake.

00:10:41.412 --> 00:10:42.709
Please.

00:10:42.859 --> 00:10:45.187
I will pay you.

00:10:45.337 --> 00:10:47.738
Deal!

00:10:48.745 --> 00:10:51.119
- Please hurry!
- OK.

00:11:18.641 --> 00:11:22.019
Doctor Frank, the pulse is not stable.

00:11:33.674 --> 00:11:37.309
Check the temperature every two hours.
Check the pulse every ten minutes.

00:11:37.459 --> 00:11:39.831
- Understood?
- Yes.

00:11:43.984 --> 00:11:45.288
Franny.

00:11:47.065 --> 00:11:48.366
Franny.

00:11:50.247 --> 00:11:51.916
Candy!

00:11:52.288 --> 00:11:54.993
You must be tired. Let me do it.

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:56.935
You are so irresponsible.

00:11:57.510 --> 00:12:01.818
It's you
who asked to take care of Mr. McGregor.

00:12:01.968 --> 00:12:02.921
Sorry.

00:12:03.071 --> 00:12:05.374
Didn't find Mina?

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:08.351
Let's talk about it later.

00:12:08.659 --> 00:12:10.620
Did the headmistress know?

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:12.172
Of course.

00:12:14.009 --> 00:12:15.744
Have some rest in the room.

00:12:15.894 --> 00:12:18.659
Check the temperature every two hours.
Check the pulse every ten minutes.

00:12:18.809 --> 00:12:20.836
- Write it down clearly.
- Ok.

00:12:21.006 --> 00:12:22.138
Candy.

00:12:22.288 --> 00:12:26.931
A nurse needs to
have a sense of responsibility.

00:12:28.077 --> 00:12:29.343
Yes.

00:12:31.926 --> 00:12:34.425
I am back, Mr. McGregor.

00:13:03.498 --> 00:13:06.899
Mina,
animals are not allowed in the hospital.

00:13:07.049 --> 00:13:09.180
You have to be good.

00:13:16.254 --> 00:13:18.256
Good night, thanks a lot.

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:51.168
No! Mina, do not bark!

00:13:53.514 --> 00:13:54.917
Mina.

00:14:00.478 --> 00:14:02.608
It's from Mr. McGregor's room.

00:14:02.758 --> 00:14:05.525
That dim-wit is making trouble again.

00:14:08.881 --> 00:14:10.113
Candy!

00:14:10.488 --> 00:14:12.759
Good evening, headmistress.

00:14:12.999 --> 00:14:15.265
That's ok.

00:14:15.415 --> 00:14:17.540
What was that noise?

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:19.820
Sounds like a dog.

00:14:20.499 --> 00:14:22.629
It's from the outside of the window.

00:14:22.779 --> 00:14:24.715
Some dogs were fighting.

00:14:26.993 --> 00:14:28.522
They ran away.

00:14:30.943 --> 00:14:32.504
Dr. Frank.

00:14:32.654 --> 00:14:34.386
Look!

00:14:36.266 --> 00:14:37.569
This....

00:14:37.773 --> 00:14:39.938
pulse is accurate?

00:14:40.088 --> 00:14:43.120
Yes, the record is thorough.

00:14:45.473 --> 00:14:47.068
The pulse is ok.

00:14:47.218 --> 00:14:49.680
Mr. McGregor will be ok?

00:14:50.696 --> 00:14:51.958
I am not sure.

00:14:52.108 --> 00:14:55.482
I can only say
things are getting better.

00:14:56.823 --> 00:14:58.763
That's great!

00:15:00.773 --> 00:15:03.684
Let me know
as soon as there is any change.

00:15:03.987 --> 00:15:05.751
It's all yours now.

00:15:05.901 --> 00:15:07.768
Yes, I know.

00:15:13.595 --> 00:15:15.935
Mina, keep it down.

00:15:22.969 --> 00:15:24.965
Mr. McGregor.

00:15:25.115 --> 00:15:27.178
Mina is here to see you.

00:15:35.325 --> 00:15:37.188
Mr. McGregor!

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:40.670
You...

00:15:44.998 --> 00:15:46.699
Mina!

00:15:48.715 --> 00:15:50.084
Mina!

00:15:50.757 --> 00:15:52.594
Mina!

00:16:29.425 --> 00:16:31.860
Doctor Frank, what are you looking at?

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:33.236
It is a miracle.

00:16:34.346 --> 00:16:35.676
A miracle?

00:16:35.826 --> 00:16:38.989
He has recovered in ten days.

00:16:39.139 --> 00:16:41.405
As a doctor,
I think it's unbelievable!

00:16:42.582 --> 00:16:44.611
That old man smiled.

00:16:44.761 --> 00:16:47.166
Yeah, first time seeing it.

00:16:49.144 --> 00:16:52.714
You are great that
you thought Mina was a person.

00:16:52.864 --> 00:16:56.067
Yeah, I thought it was a beautiful lady.

00:16:58.887 --> 00:17:02.225
To me,
Mina is more important than people.

00:17:02.375 --> 00:17:06.215
In this world, I only trust Mina.

00:17:07.758 --> 00:17:10.497
Now, there is one more person.

00:17:11.576 --> 00:17:13.069
You.

00:17:13.219 --> 00:17:15.219
I am a dim-wit.

00:17:16.061 --> 00:17:18.830
No, you are great!

00:17:18.980 --> 00:17:22.320
You knew she was a dog.
But you still brought her to me.

00:17:23.493 --> 00:17:25.730
Mina wants to see you, too!

00:17:26.372 --> 00:17:28.976
When I get better,
I will bring her to visit you.

00:17:29.452 --> 00:17:32.656
That's great!
I am going to charge for it.

00:17:32.806 --> 00:17:34.233
You money lover!

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:39.560
Candy.

00:17:40.031 --> 00:17:43.638
- William Adley....
- Grandfather William?

00:17:43.915 --> 00:17:47.455
Yes. I said bad things about him...

00:17:47.733 --> 00:17:50.266
No, I recognized a wrong person.

00:17:53.021 --> 00:17:55.966
You know grandfather William?

00:17:56.236 --> 00:18:00.345
I have never seen him.
I've only heard his name.

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:06.972
He must be a nice person
to be willing to adopt you.

00:18:07.122 --> 00:18:10.221
Sure.
Grandfather William is better than you.

00:18:10.833 --> 00:18:12.567
I am sorry.

00:18:14.347 --> 00:18:17.483
I'll bring Mina to see you next time.

00:18:17.633 --> 00:18:20.734
No,
I'll bring her to meet you next time.

00:18:21.579 --> 00:18:25.516
Right!
I have a pair of ribbons for you.

00:18:25.666 --> 00:18:27.000
Ribbons?

00:18:27.907 --> 00:18:29.881
Like Mina's?

00:18:32.325 --> 00:18:33.820
You will be pretty.

00:18:34.267 --> 00:18:37.640
And we can go fishing together.

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:39.846
To that beautiful lake?

00:18:39.996 --> 00:18:41.660
You know it?

00:18:43.809 --> 00:18:45.805
Mina told me.

00:18:45.955 --> 00:18:48.286
That place is my secret.

00:18:48.436 --> 00:18:50.894
It's a secret between three people.

00:18:51.308 --> 00:18:52.803
No.

00:18:54.991 --> 00:18:57.228
It's two people and one dog.

00:19:17.254 --> 00:19:20.632
You have to get well soon for this wish.

00:19:23.147 --> 00:19:26.217
I feel much better.

00:19:26.929 --> 00:19:29.733
I haven't been in such a good mood
for a long time.

00:19:29.883 --> 00:19:34.991
Let's decorate the ward with petals.
It must smell very good.

00:19:36.437 --> 00:19:41.818
It feels like snowflakes are falling.
So sleepy.

00:19:41.968 --> 00:19:45.004
I am going to pick some petals.
Please wait for a moment.

00:20:05.597 --> 00:20:07.001
Mr. McGregor.

00:20:07.673 --> 00:20:10.378
Mr. McGregor, look! So many...

00:20:11.289 --> 00:20:13.491
Come on. Let's go back to your room.

00:20:16.277 --> 00:20:18.274
These petals....

00:20:22.939 --> 00:20:25.381
Mr. McGregor!

00:20:37.001 --> 00:20:38.770
Mr. McGregor!

00:20:39.545 --> 00:20:41.645
Wake up, Mr. McGregor!

00:20:42.492 --> 00:20:46.133
We are going fishing after you recover.
You promised me!

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:50.120
How did this happen?

00:20:51.631 --> 00:20:56.084
I took care of you so hard.

00:20:58.327 --> 00:21:00.001
Mr. McGregor!

00:21:04.621 --> 00:21:08.157
No matter how much Candy calls,
no matter how much she cries,

00:21:08.307 --> 00:21:11.307
Mr. McGregor will never open his eyes.

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:14.652
The petals are falling like snowflakes.

00:21:14.802 --> 00:21:19.740
Candy recalls Anthony
who is sleeping in the petals.

00:21:19.890 --> 00:21:23.130
She can't help feeling sad.
